  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Caladin4
  <Text>k__BackingField: I've been the tinker here for many years. Gatherin' stuff.
    Fixin' stuff. Buildin' stuff. But since my accident a little while ago, been
    forced into an early retirement of sorts.
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Callum sent me to help.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55bf0cfe8c542c7409bdada4ad2edd63, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Accident?
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 45d122be7864c4a4cbd472f36de0086a, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Sorry to hear that.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 46073de051b4d874697d58f17fc9793a, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I gotta go.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4035cb45884995c4e860917c78688710, type: 2}
